  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Indrakumar S/O Sawaldas Nagdeve vs State Of Maharashtra Thr Pso., ... on 6 January, 2026 2026:Bhc-Nag:118 1 5 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Nagpur Bench, Nagpur. Criminal Application (Aba) No.866 Of 2025 Indrakumar s/o Sawaldas Nagdeve Vs. State of Maharashtra __________________________________________________________________ Office Notes, Office Memoranda of Coram, appearances, Court's orders of directions Court's or Judge's and Registrar's Orders. Shri K.S. Motwani, Advocate for applicant. Shri N.S. Autkar, App for non-applicant/State. Coram : M.W. Chandwani, J. Date : 06.01.2026. 1.",
    "facts": "3. It appears that a raid was conducted and contraband scented tobacco worth 5 lakhs alongwith a vehicle have been seized from one Lalit Gopaldas Rathi, who is the co- accused, who was arrested and later on released on bail. During investigation, the name of the present applicant was revealed. The material against the present applicant reveals that the vehicle containing contraband scented tobacco was parked in front of the shop of the applicant.",
